Package: devjam-external-keyring
Version: 1.6-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenPGP keys for external apt repositories
 Signing keys of third-party apt repositories used on dev-jam systems,
 such as Signal, Syncthing, OnlyOffice, Nextcloud Office, XanMod,
 Liquorix, XLibre, Waydroid, SR Research, ArtCraft, the GitHub CLI and
 the OpenSesame (cogscinl) PPA, installed in /usr/share/keyrings for use
 with Signed-By in deb822 .sources files.
